# Colyseus

- One room type: `campus` — presence + chat only
- Schema changes require updating `types/` and both client/server consumers
- Movement is client-authoritative; server relays, does not simulate physics
- Do not store quest progress on the server in v1
- Keep `maxClients` documented (25); do not add auth middleware without an ADR
- No PeerJS or WebRTC on the server
